          "The initial VA examination did not address proximate causation between PTSD and sleep apnea",
          "The examiner failed to opine on whether PTSD aggravated the apnea"
        ]
      },
      "supporting_evidence_needed": [
        "Copy of the original VA sleep apnea examination",
        "Evidence that the examiner was not asked to address PTSD causation",
        "Evidence that the examination did not review PTSD-related symptoms or their temporal relationship to apnea",
        "Medical literature or expert evidence showing that PTSD-apnea nexus is a recognized medical phenomenon that examination should explore"
