        "principle": "If sleep apnea was ever granted based on a nexus to PTSD, subsequent denial without changed circumstances would constitute clear and unmistakable error.",
        "applicability": "Only viable if prior favorable rating exists."
      },
      "supporting_evidence_needed": [
        "Evidence of prior service-connection approval for sleep apnea on PTSD nexus theory",
        "Identification of the error in the prior decision (whether factual or legal)",
        "Evidence that no intervening change in law or material fact occurred"
      ],
      "current_evidence_gaps": [
        "**Prior decision status**: unknown whether sleep apnea was ever previously service-connected",
        "**Record history**: no information on whether this is an initial denial or a reopened/reduced case"
